(text "Default build: VOUT = 3.3 V (fixed resistor divider - no trimmer). Other outputs: change only R_top/R_bot (and L where shown) per the VOUT table." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 19.30 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "19e16f5b-d404-4979-8daa-0c78dc126840"))
(text "DESIGN EQUATIONS - MAX17506 (Maxim 19-8526, Applications Information)\nDesign point: VIN 24 V nom (6.5-60 V), VOUT 3.3 V, IOUT 5 A, fSW 450 kHz (RT open), PFM (MODE/SYNC open)\nInductor: L = VOUT/(2.2*fSW) = 3.33 uH -> 3.3 uH XAL7070-332ME ; ISAT > 8.8 A runaway limit (RDL open)\nCrossover: fC = fSW/9 (<=450 kHz) = 50 kHz ; tRESP = 0.33/fC + 1/fSW = 8.82 us\nOutput cap: COUT = 0.5*ISTEP*tRESP/dVOUT = 111.4 uF eff required ; fitted 2x47u + 22u (~74.5u eff) -> dV 148 mV\nFB divider: R3 = 451e3/(fC[kHz]*COUT_SEL[uF]) = 121k -> 121k ;  R4 = R3*0.9/(VOUT-0.9) = 45.3k\n  VOUT = 0.9*(1+R3/R4) = 3.304 V (PWM/DCM, VFB 0.900 V) ; 3.359 V in PFM (VFB 0.915 V)\nDL / N1: SiS468DN low-side MOSFET, 4.7R gate resistor; DL-SGND resistance open -> IPEAK 7.8 A, IRUNAWAY 8.8 A, hiccup\nSoft-start: CSS >= 28e-6*CSEL*VOUT ; tSS = CSS/5.55uA = 4.0 ms with 22 nF\nEN/UVLO: R1 = 3.32M, R2 = R1*1.215/(VINU-1.215) = 845k for VINU = 6.0 V\nBST 0.1uF; VCC 2.2uF; CF open (fSW >= 450 kHz); EXTVCC to SGND (VOUT < 4.84 V); RESET 10k to VOUT.\nGENERIC CHECKS @ VIN=24V nom / 60V max, VOUT=3.3V, IOUT=5A, fSW=450kHz\n  D = VOUT/VIN = 0.137\n  dIL = VOUT(1-VOUT/VIN)/(L*fSW): 1.92A @nom, 2.10A @max  (42% of IOUT)\n  IL_PK = IOUT + dIL/2 = 6.05A ; inductor ISAT must exceed 8.8A (runaway limit)  (XAL7070-332ME: ISAT 14A)\n  ICIN_RMS = IOUT*sqrt(D(1-D)) = 1.72A (max IOUT/2 = 2.50A at D=0.5)\n  dVIN = IOUT*D(1-D)/(fSW*CIN) = 412mV with CIN_eff=3.2uF\n  dVOUT_ripple = dIL/(8*fSW*COUT) = 7.1mV with COUT_eff=74.5uF (ESR excluded)\n  tON @VINmax = VOUT/(VIN*fSW) = 122ns vs tON_MIN(max)=160ns -> pulse skipping possible near VINmax\n  Max VIN without pulse skipping = VOUT/(tON_MIN*fSW) = 45.8V\n  Min VIN (dropout) ~ (VOUT+IOUT*R)/(1-fSW*tOFF_MIN) = 3.83V\nIC THERMAL @ VIN nom, full load (datasheet Power Dissipation / thermal sections)\n  Pcond=IL_RMS^2*1.4*(D*RDS_HS+(1-D)*RDS_LS)=0.22W, Psw=0.5*VIN*IOUT*tsw*fSW=0.40W (tsw~15ns), Pq=0.07W\n  RDS_HS=45mOhm, RDS_LS=external FET typ (datasheet EC table)\n  PIC = 0.70W ; thetaJA = 23 C/W (EV kit) -> TJ = TA + thetaJA*PIC = 41C @25C, 101C @85C ; TA(max) for TJ=125C = 109C\n  Inductor DCR loss = IOUT^2*DCR = 0.30W" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 165.10 0) (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left top)) (uuid "90773588-86db-4d08-8cc4-50f3ab87c6a9"))
